#. Context: Victor, the demon fuser at the Gouma-Den. 266-268: first meeting, where he gives the player
#. the handheld computer. 278-311: his advice and comments, which change over the story.
#. Speaker: 業魔殿の主人 = Gouma-Den master (English names as used in the patch).
