msgid ""
"今度は警察署で騒動ですか………[wait][box]最近、街全体に落ち着きがないように\n"
"思えてしまって……私も歳ですかね。[wait]"
msgstr ""

#. Scene: Bar.
#. Context: The bar: the master and customers. Customer gossip (605-641) changes as the story moves on.
#. 642-648: drink menu messages.
#. Limit: Text box: 3 lines of 40 letters (20 tiles, 2 letters per tile). The build re-wraps lines, so
#. line breaks are only hints. If a line needs more room, add [wait][box] to start another box.
#. Tags: [box] = start a new text box; [wait] = wait for the player to press a button.
#: SHOPSMP.EVE:634
msgctxt "SHOPSMP.EVE#634"
msgid ""
"よく、天堂家と警察の関わりが\n"
"噂されてたけど、どうやら\n"
"現実のものに、なってしまったようね。[wait][box]今、警察署に行けば、\n"
"裏の顔が見られるんでしょう？\n"
"ねぇ、探偵さん。[wait]"
msgstr ""

#. Scene: Bar.
#. Context: The bar: the master and customers. Customer gossip (605-641) changes as the story moves on.
#. 642-648: drink menu messages.
#. Limit: Text box: 3 lines of 40 letters (20 tiles, 2 letters per tile). The build re-wraps lines, so
#. line breaks are only hints. If a line needs more room, add [wait][box] to start another box.
#. Tags: [wait] = wait for the player to press a button.
#: SHOPSMP.EVE:635
