"嫌な世の中ですね。\n"
"警察がダメなら、他に誰を信じれば\n"
"いいんでしょうか。[wait]"
msgstr ""

#. Scene: Bar.
#. Context: The bar: the master and customers. Customer gossip (605-641) changes as the story moves on.
#. 642-648: drink menu messages.
#. Limit: Text box: 3 lines of 40 letters (20 tiles, 2 letters per tile). The build re-wraps lines, so
